{{Heroic Card Infobox|Cost=2|AbilityCost=1|Rarity=Epic|Type=Spell|Arena=Jungle Arena|ReleaseDate=2 March 2026}}{{Quote|They see him rollin', they hatin'! No one clears the path like Hero Barbarian Barrel, who willingly gave up his rock music career for the resilience of a second roll.}}
The Heroic Barbarian is a {{Rarity|Epic}} [[Cards|card]] that is unlocked with 200 {{Icon|I=Hero Shard}}. It is an area-damage, ground-targeting [[:Category:Spell Cards|spell]] with a short rectangular area and moderate damage. It can only be deployed on the player's own side. Once the spell reaches its destination, it spawns a single [[Barbarians|Barbarian]]. It is a spiked barrel with a Barbarian inside it.A Heroic Barbarian Barrel card costs 2 {{Icon|I=Elixir}} to deploy.

== '''Ability: Rowdy Reroll''' ==
{{Quote|Barrels down the lane a second time for maximum impact.}}{{Hero Ability|1=Rowdy Reroll}}
The Hero Knight has a special ability accessible from whatever side of the screen was put in, just above the player's [[Cards|card]] slots in [[Basics of Battle|battle]]. When activatet, the Barbarian Barrel will roll for a second time, while healling the barbarian for 50% of the damage. The Rowdy Reroll ability costs 1 [[Elixir]] to activate.

== '''Strategy''' ==
*The ability can get the barbarian closer to the crown tower while healing some hp, forcing more elixir on defense.
*The roll can also kill more swarms, or get behind troops.

